        {
            "@id": "/recipe/galbi-jjim/comment-page-5#sso/comment/55015",
            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "Comment",
            "url": "https://www.maangchi.com/recipe/galbi-jjim/comment-page-5#comment-55015",
            "name": "Comment by lindleylew on February 1, 2025",
            "description": "I made this for the first time tonight! I wanted to make it for Lunar New Year, but had to&hellip;",
            "text": "I made this for the first time tonight! I wanted to make it for Lunar New Year, but had to find a store that had the short ribs first. The actual cooking took quite a bit longer than expected because of the thickness of my short ribs. I started to get flustered it wouldn&#039;t turn out, but I took my time and everything was fine in the end. Tasted great! :) I love your recipes, Maangchi! I had to make a profile to leave comments because I&#039;ve been making a lot lately. I made your kimchi a few days ago. Tastes great now, but can&#039;t wait for it to ferment for a couple weeks!",
            "dateCreated": "2025-02-01T01:39:20-05:00",
            "author": {
                "@context": "https://schema.org",
                "@type": "Person",
                "name": "lindleylew"
            }
        },
        {
