            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "Comment",
            "url": "https://www.maangchi.com/recipe/galbi-jjim/comment-page-5#comment-54934",
            "name": "Reply by Maangchi on October 28, 2024",
            "description": "It may be nice to make a delicious galbi-jjim in a stew-like style with a bit more broth. Try adding&hellip;",
            "text": "It may be nice to make a delicious galbi-jjim in a stew-like style with a bit more broth. Try adding more water and adjust the soy sauce or salt to your taste while cooking. Good luck!",
