            "text": "This is my traditional galbijjim recipe. And another easy galbijjim recipe is here. https://www.maangchi.com/recipe/makgalbi-jjim If you are looking for the galbijjim video that I filmed in 2008, here you go. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-CP9gKR9GR4",
