            "name": "Comment by everybodyneedsalinda on August 30, 2014",
            "description": "my mom told me that she rounds out (root) vegetables so that when they cook the edges don&#039;t get mushy&hellip;",
            "text": "my mom told me that she rounds out (root) vegetables so that when they cook the edges don&#039;t get mushy and keeps them evenly cooked (and handsome looking).",
